				2.35.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				862.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				6.7.29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
			</span></i><i>inPrm.</i><i><span class="en">
